  "body": "For https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/137 we want URL's href attribute to also be the value the serializer returns. However, it's already the stringifier and as far as I can tell the IDL grammar does not allow for both. There's the prose escape-hatch of course, but that seems sad?",
